  <front>
    <title>Edwards-Curve Digital Security Algorithm (EdDSA) for DNSSEC</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="8080" stream="IETF"/>
    <date year="2017" month="February"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document describes how to specify Edwards-curve Digital Security
Algorithm (EdDSA) keys and signatures in DNS Security (DNSSEC).  It
uses EdDSA with the choice of two curves: Ed25519 and Ed448.</t>
    </abstract>
